@1 = ~Orina scams people! Don't buy food from her. I'm a baker, and I need flour and honey. If you have either, I can buy it off you for a good price. I've baked some cookies, if you'd like a taste.~
@2 = ~Let me see what you have for sale.~
@3 = ~I have some flour. Will you pay 70 gold pieces?~
@4 = ~I have some honey. Will you pay 45 gold pieces?~
@5 = ~Maybe another time.~
